~ start
Fenn: It's really dark.
Az: I know the light's around here, somewhere.
Lights flash on.
Az: Hmph. Everything looks the same, mostly.
Az: Wait, where's the pict- oh. Huh.
Winston: WELCOME, FOOLS
Camera pans out to reveal the big machine
Az: Whoa. Nevermind.
Winston: WHOA, INDEED!
Winston: BEHOLDETH!
Fenn: By the Sender! It- what- what is it?
Winston: MINE OWN LATEST CREATION. THE ICI-CLONE.
Winston: Thou seeth, mine own power is limited. I may maketh things. Devices, weapons, creatures... but I cannot controleth those folk.
Winston: SO, I thought to myself, what can I controleth?
Fenn: Your attitude?
Az: Your incompetence?
Winston: I CAN CONTROLETH MYSELF.
Fenn: Uh oh...
Az: Hm.
Winston: Why- if I maketh a copyeth of myself... wouldst it not wanteth the same things I wanteth? Wouldst  it not do-eth the same things I wouldst?
Fenn: Here we go, Wizard man! I'm ready.
Az: Hold on, Fenn. Let's see what happens.
Winston: THUS! WITESS THE CREATION OF THE ONE. THE ONLY.
Winston: ICETON
Machine whirs, and opens
Smoke bellows and then clears to reveal an ice version of winston
Winston: Holy sh- it worked? IT WORKED?!
Fenn: Are we in danger?
Az: Hmph. Maybe.
Winston: ICETON, GO! ATTACKETH THEM! DESTROYETH THEM!
Iceton takes a few steps towards Az and Fenn. Az and Fenn retreat in sync.
Fenn: Uh oh.
Iceton turns around, rushes towards Winston, and starts beating him up.
Az: Huh?
Fenn: Winston?
Winston: NAY! No no no NO! STOP!
Winston: No, please. Please, stop!
Az: Dang. I really thought we were in danger there for a sec.
Fenn: Az, we have to help him.
Az: Ugh... seriously?
Fenn: He needs help! He's in dan-
Az: I know! I know. I don't like it, but I'll grab him.
Az: And you have to get out of here. It's not safe for you either.
Fenn: But, what about you?
Az: I should be able to hold off the ice guy. Here-
Az walks to a lever and pulls it, dropping the floor from underneath Fenn and Iceton
Az: Wait, NO! Fenn, watch out! Iceton's going down with you!
Az: UGH. There should be a way back to the Great Hall from those tunnels, be careful!
Fenn: Got it!
Winston: Ugh...
Az: Let's go, wizard boy.
do EventFlags.set_flag("AzWs-FinalConfrontation-Workshop", true)
=> END